      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gibraltar Barracks, Bury St Edmunds is a military installation in Bury St Edmunds, opened in 1878, and served as the depot for the 12th (East Suffolk) Regiment of Foot until 1881."</data>
